-requirements/srd001-testutils.yaml (full SRD for differential testing harness)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (shared_protocols section -- DiffTest pattern and BuildBinary usage)\n      - CLAUDE.md (differential testing pattern showing BuildBinary and RunDiffTests usage)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/testutils/difftest.go\n        action: create\n        note: All exported types and function signatures as Go stubs with panic(\"not implemented\") bodies\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Define DiffTest struct with fields Name string, Args []string, Stdin []byte, Env []string, WorkDir string, ExitCode int, Normalize []NormalizeFunc, ExpectedFiles map[string][]byte\n      - id: R2\n        text: Define NormalizeFunc type alias as func([]byte) []byte and declare ComposeNormalizers and TimestampNormalizer exports\n      - id: R3\n        text: Define RunDiffTests function signature accepting *testing.T, goBinary string, refBinary string, tests []DiffTest\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Primary file is difftest.go (named after the primary exported type DiffTest, not testutils.go)\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Package is github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/testutils\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Import constraints: must not import any cmd/ package or any other pkg/ package\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"All function bodies are panic(\\\"not implemented\\\") stubs -- this is a contract task, not an implementation task\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: pkg/testutils/difftest.go compiles without errors (go build ./pkg/testutils/...)\n      - id: AC2\n        text: DiffTest struct is exported with all fields matching the contract signature\n      - id: AC3\n        text: RunDiffTests, ComposeNormalizers, and TimestampNormalizer are exported with correct signatures\n      - id: AC4\n        text: No imports of cmd/ or other pkg/ packages\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] pkg/format