rom humansize.go with correct signatures\n      - id: AC3\n        text: All five color functions are exported from color.go with correct signatures\n      - id: AC4\n        text: PadRight, PadLeft, and Columns are exported from columns.go with correct signatures\n\n- index: 2\n  title: \"[stitch] pkg/testutils -- srd001-testutils R1, R2, R3, R4\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd001-testutils.yaml (full SRD -- all requirements for the differential testing harness)\n      - pkg/testutils/difftest.go (contract stubs from prior task -- replace panic bodies with implementations)\n      - CLAUDE.md (differential testing pattern showing BuildBinary and RunDiffTests usage in cmd/ packages)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (shared_protocols section -- DiffTest execution pattern)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/testutils/difftest.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Replace stub bodies with full implementations of RunDiffTests, ComposeNormalizers, TimestampNormalizer\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement RunDiffTests -- execute goBinary and refBinary with identical args, stdin, env, and workdir from each DiffTest; compare stdout, stderr, and exit code; report divergence with input, expected, and actual\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement ComposeNormalizers -- chain multiple NormalizeFunc into one, applying in order\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement TimestampNormalizer -- strip or replace timestamps in output bytes so time-varying outputs can be compared\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement BuildBinary -- compile the cmd/ package at the given path using go build, returning the path to the built binary; use t.TempDir for output location\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"RunDiffTests calls t.Run for each DiffTest.Name to produce named subtests\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Binary execution uses os/exec.Co